BSD Daemon artwork
==================

Poul-Henning Kamp's rendition of the FreeBSD daemon, sourced from:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Daemon-phk.svg

Beerware License, Revision 42:

Poul-Henning Kamp wrote this file. As long as you retain this notice you
can do whatever you want with this stuff. If we meet some day, and you
think this stuff is worth it, you can buy Poul-Henning Kamp a beer in
return.

The PNG distributed with open-media-drc is a transparent-background
rasterization of that SVG, scaled to 192 pixels high without changing its
aspect ratio, with a pair of headphones added (flat gray band and silver
ear cups) to match the site's audio theme. Permitted under the same
Beerware terms above.
